                     "text" : "•\tFor Comparer – we MIGHT need to make that an optional CTOR parameter – overloaded. Most people will use the one that doesn’t specify the comparer. Buf if oyu have a comparer field, and copy it, and allow assign to it – that maybe needed to get lambdas working with containers/comparers. Review STL set impl of this.",
